{
  "info": {
    "name": "P2M LOS API",
    "description": "Loan Origination System API — Auth, PAN, Personal Info, Aadhaar (DigiLocker), Bank, Employment, Documents, Selfie, GeoLocation, Loan Application, Step Progress.\n\n## Auth Flow\n1. Collection is pre-configured with Bearer `{{accessToken}}` auth. Endpoints that need a token (everything except Auth) inherit it automatically.\n2. **Send OTP** → response is captured to `{{userId}}` (test script).\n3. **Verify OTP** → response is captured to `{{accessToken}}` and `{{userId}}` (test script). All subsequent requests use the new token automatically.\n4. A collection-level pre-request script decodes the JWT, logs expiry time, and warns (without blocking) if the token is about to expire.\n\n## Variables\nAll inputs (mobiles, OTPs, names, account numbers, etc.) are collection variables. Set the ones you need before running, or just edit the `Tests` script on Send OTP to log the inputs.\n\n## Base URL\nDefault is the dev ngrok backend. Change `{{baseUrl}}` in the collection variables to point at staging or production.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "p2m-los"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const token = pm.collectionVariables.get('accessToken');",
          "if (!token) {",
          "  console.warn('[auth] No accessToken set. Run Send OTP → Verify OTP first.');",
          "  return;",
          "}",
          "try {",
          "  const parts = token.split('.');",
          "  if (parts.length !== 3) return;",
          "  const payload = JSON.parse(pm.environment.replaceIn(Buffer.from(parts[1], 'base64url').toString('utf8')));",
          "  if (payload.exp) {",
          "    const expiresAt = new Date(payload.exp * 1000);",
          "    const now = Date.now();",
          "    const minutesLeft = Math.round((payload.exp * 1000 - now) / 60000);",
          "    console.log(`[auth] Token expires at ${expiresAt.toISOString()} (in ${minutesLeft} min)`);",
          "    if (payload.exp * 1000 < now) {",
          "      console.error('[auth] Token has EXPIRED. Re-run Verify OTP to refresh.');",
          "    } else if (minutesLeft < 5) {",
          "      console.warn(`[auth] Token expires in <5 min. Re-run Verify OTP soon.`);",
          "    }",
          "  }",
          "} catch (e) {",
          "  console.warn('[auth] Could not decode token (not a JWT?):', e.message);",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
